


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_5089ed16:



    voice "2HI_0585"
    hina "「盛况啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_03abe4b4:


    "问题和讨论声一个接着一个的，文的讲习会应该一时半会儿还结束不了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_12eef414:



    voice "2RI_0599"
    rin "「真是太热闹了，是不是又多了几个人？这个还有边上班级的人来吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_64525dc4:



    voice "2MI_0520"
    miyako "「用心地回答每一个人的文同学好厉害」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_bac1bdef:



    voice "2HI_0586"
    hina "「是啊，要不直接去家庭教室手把手教吧，可能更快些」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_58724b65:



    voice "2RI_0600"
    rin "「哎，回去还有时间去买东西吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_1bd75471:



    voice "2HI_0587"
    hina "「没事的，小文记着呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_09ce9385:


    "与话里满是等不耐烦口气的伦相比，阳菜要平静得多。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_4068339f:



    voice "2HI_0588"
    hina "「今年小文也教了我怎么做巧克力，有空试着做做吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_4af3c668:



    voice "2MI_0521"
    miyako "「学之前都是怎么吃到的呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_bd9bd998:



    voice "2HI_0589"
    hina "「一直都是妈妈姐姐做的，不过包装是我自己包的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_f391a962:



    voice "2RI_0601"
    rin "「啊～那个巨乳—哈呜！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_e362a190:


    "朝着伦的小腿就是一脚。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_79f1c516:



    voice "2HI_0590"
    hina "「本来之前都只是给爸爸就行了，但今年……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_d4004e10:


    "阳菜望着的无疑是文。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_cd5d041a:



    voice "2MI_0522"
    miyako "「听起来好棒」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_b694ab0f:



    voice "2HI_0591"
    hina "「嘿嘿」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_2d1aae1c:



    voice "2RI_0602"
    rin "「我每年都是负责收巧克力的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_b3faf575:



    voice "2MI_0523"
    miyako "「噢噢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_d424d29f:



    voice "2HI_0592"
    hina "「你就是这种地方啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_5ef92897:



    voice "2RI_0603"
    rin "「羡慕什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_7b987589:



    voice "2HI_0593"
    hina "「唉……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_8d095379:


    "虽然知道不是成心想嘲讽的。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_1ccfdf9b:



    voice "2RI_0604"
    rin "「不过话说我不是很能吃甜的啊，每年都吃不完。对了！泡到沸水里用在白色情人节那天——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_4c68338e:



    voice "2HI_0594"
    hina "「所以说，你就是这种地方啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_54ff49a1:



    voice "2RI_0605"
    rin "「咦，生气了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_50585f35:



    voice "2HI_0595"
    hina "「没生气，只是很无语。稍微考虑下送给你的人的心情啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_beffaf6f:



    voice "2RI_0606"
    rin "「可是，反正送我的肯定都只是人情巧克力」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_fff9c056:



    voice "2HI_0596"
    hina "「就算是人情也要啊。也不是说一定要你亲自做才算有谢意」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_5a7bfa64:



    voice "2RI_0607"
    rin "「哎、哎、热水泡不也是亲手做的吗？你说是吧，圣夜夜？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_28892395:



    voice "2MI_0524"
    miyako "「伦你这种地方啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_71e202b4:



    voice "2RI_0608"
    rin "「喔、噢噢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou1_01_f362d245:


    "就是这种地方啊。"
